---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — High Thinking">
  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:center; margin-bottom: 24px;"><Logo size={56} /></div>
  <h1 style="text-align:center; font-weight:400;">About The Priest</h1>
  <p>
    High Thinking is written under a pen name. That's a deliberate choice, not a gimmick — it keeps the
    writing judged on the argument, not the author, and it lets the geopolitics musings here stay honest
    without turning into a professional liability for the person behind them.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site covers three things: personal development, personal finance, and geopolitics. The throughline
    is compounding — small disciplined steps in a habit, a portfolio, or a worldview, taken consistently
    over a long horizon.
  </p>
  <h2 style="font-weight:400;">On AI assistance</h2>
  <p>
    Some posts here are drafted with AI help for research, structure, or a first pass — the way plenty of
    writers now use a research assistant. The opinions, edits, and final calls are The Priest's own.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
